Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,死人血对吸血鬼来说是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man's blood is posion to vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大多关于吸血鬼的传言都是鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most Vampires'lore is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死他们的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是砍头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is by beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 Dean 我是Jody Mills\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Dean,Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody,Are you sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好回来面对这些东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ready to jump back in the fray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这些鬼东西一直不肯放过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wackodoo stuff keeps coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解他们越多 就越有能力对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More I know,better armed I 'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是也\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,重生了一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不做我信守不了的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make promises I can't keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我很享受去教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy church.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,经过了发生在我儿子和丈夫身上的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean after my son and my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一些对我来说有意义的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed something that made sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 小姐 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,Missy,calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:00:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank 有人砸碎了前门玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Frank,someone smashed the front window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在达尔文五金店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over at Dawson's Hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是入室抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible B&E.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,需要你去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 可是犯人候审间这里还有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,copy that,but bullpen isn't empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这有我拘留的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got someone to hold in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,警长正赶去警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff is heading to the station now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't be alone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.73,0:01:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别丢下我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你在这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are,girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,非要问出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really need to ask that,do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人和你在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the others with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都去猎食的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone was off on a hunt when.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现你逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized you'd run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定帮你和他们一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured I'd do you and them a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们发现你跑了之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And come take cared of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,过来把这事处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they even know we are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能进来抓我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,警察们都忙着查我伪造的入室抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops sure was in a hurry to check that B&E I faked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没看到我进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely even saw me coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以逃跑 可以藏起来 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run and you can hide,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最终都会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩可真养眼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys are a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你肩膀怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,只在下雨天才会疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only aches when it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩最近如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you boys been.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还不错 - 随时准备逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peachy - Touch and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你给我们准备了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what you got for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个吸血鬼 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,that's a vamp,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来Jody不再需要我们的帮助了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Jody might not need our help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 娃娃们都长大了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,they grow up too fast,don't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,玩笑随便开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,joke all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这些东西的老窝里还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where this came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下昨晚抓住了一个逃跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man brought in a runaway last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她身上没有身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no ID on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on her,actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,除了一张离开内布拉斯加州的车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for a bus ticket out of Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不明身份的极致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total Jane Doe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她甚至不肯说自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't even give me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这姑娘简直就是野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl basically feral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无教养\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got zero manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了她的命 连句谢谢也不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't even thank me for saving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这位兄台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow,this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为了接近她可是费了一番力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to plenty of trouble to get at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,从他的话语里听出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to hear him tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人跟他一样都想要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others will want her at least as bad as he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听起来像是个吸血鬼窝 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like a nest - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这地方一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有听起来那么温暖舒适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't half as cute and cozy as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilson和Fisher\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilson and Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩要是FBI 我就是Taylor Swift\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two FBI,then I'm Taylor Swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是取我牙齿证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a dental ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在查我有没有獠牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a fang check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为警长经过猎人的特训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because hunters trained the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你应该先说句谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first word out of your mouth shoud be a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底和吸血鬼是什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who were you to these vamps,anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底有什么特殊之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so special about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的老窝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到和她吻合的DNA了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a match of her DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie Jones\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,报告上说她06年在卡诺什被诱拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reported abducted outside Kanosh 06'
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是被祖父母抚养长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raised by an elderly grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他活着的亲人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No living kins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得当年是吸血鬼把她掳走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the vamps are the ones took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟吸血鬼同居8年可够久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years is long time for human live with vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还不被杀死或者同化似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without getting killed or turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看那个吸血鬼跟她交谈的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was something familier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好像他们很相熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the way this vamp talked to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她这里有条伤疤 吸血鬼吸食留下的伤疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she had scars on the,feeding scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伤痕都分层了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are layered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是历经数年留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if they've been built on for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说她是个吸血鬼奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she is a bloodslave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以前见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼把人类当做宠物 或者活的饲料库圈养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires keeping people as pets,human feedbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes these slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对他们的主人非常忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay loyal to the captors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你指\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this girl's not talking cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这女孩不肯说是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a case of what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为吸血鬼斯德哥尔摩综合症吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampiric Stockholm syndrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她在保护老窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's protecting the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你感到愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you feel a debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给你地方住 养育你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave you a home,raised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie 我们懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie,we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,忠诚是一种强大的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty is a very powerful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我叫Alex - 不 这不是你名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is Alex - No,it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你的真名是Annie Jones\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is Annie Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼把你偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those vampires stole you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是怪物Annie\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are monsters Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们根本不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只爱你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They loved your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是他们的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fed on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.95,0:06:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是我喂他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}My choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我同胞 我饿了他们给我吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brothers,they brought me food when I was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们猎食失败的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when they struck out on a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我喂饱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你很在乎他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok,you care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会无缘无故离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason you decided to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候离开他们 靠我自己活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To move on and get along on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不会乖乖接受你逃跑的事实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That decision is gonna sit with the rest of the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有人找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them already pursued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为 当其他人发现你逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think when the rest of them find out that you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会放过你 会善罢甘休吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just gonna shrug and cut their losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他们一起生活了那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lived with them for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们尝过你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've tasted your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对你的气味知根知底\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've had your scent down cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你能逃多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean how far can you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,躲多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没考虑过 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think this out,did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,会伤害到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,例如 你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother,for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫Cody\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是她杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为你做出的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the choice you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有因必有果\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们 还是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能保护你的安全 我们能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can help you,we can keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,同时你也得帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,老窝在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈知道我逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会找到我 然后杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama finds me,she'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mills 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mills,you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪她没谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder she didn't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那怪胎是她哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creep was her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那什么 其实我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,mostly,I'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我在想她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hung up on the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex和Annie明明很像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex and Annie,they are so close already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还要改名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd they change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从她的车票可知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so we know from her ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex从内布拉斯加州的奥尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Alex hopped a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,上了一辆客车 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of O'Neill,Nebraska,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯对 - 显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hmm - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能追踪到具体地点更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be better to go in with a firm location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过镇子也不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the town ain't that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有洞穴或者其他野外的藏身地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no caves or other natural hiding places.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就去查个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so go in,canvass it cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了一张表归纳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I work together a short list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可能的老窝所在地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of possible nest locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有一家闲置的消防站\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an empty fire station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还有四五家没人的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four or five derelict homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一天就能查完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing we couldn't hit in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人能看住她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To babysit her by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然女孩喜欢开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,well,girls are flight risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也不算友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该应付的过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I can handle baby-sitting detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个警局已经暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The station's been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好去避一避风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be worth heading upwind for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼擅长跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamps are trakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好极了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terrific - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我在郊外有一所小木屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an old family cabine outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以住那儿 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That'll work - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,失踪一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't raise too many eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大概没人会在意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me being gone for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此 你确定不要我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe,but sure you don't want backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我为了躲避吸血鬼的追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to enlist my men in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去惊动我的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protection detail against vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank还不知道昨晚袭击的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's in the dark about what hit him last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他看行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy still his nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上都能做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the barn episode of Walking Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are good cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接受不了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 你以前查资料的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody,at your late night reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有遇到过死人血这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever come across anything about dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼一粘马上就能晕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes vamps down like a horse tranq.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西好 我要备点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not say no to some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说我有多想用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,not that I'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是你们要去找他们的老窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys're gonna jump on these vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在他们意识到自己家里人不见了之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be back here before they even realise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,安全回来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their kin's missing,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ralph今天没上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ralph didn't show up for work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能连上两班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to pull a double shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,马上到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Conner你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conner,you scared the.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不应该跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I shouldn't have snuck up on you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只是 你最近有看见Alex吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just,you haven't seen Alex around,have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你妹妹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我没见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I can't say I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说卖给她车票的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh,so you didn't sell her the bus-ticket outa town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你在问我有没有帮你那个自闭症的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I help your shut-in kid sister get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,从她那个怪胎窝里离家出走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird scary-ass squatter family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer's still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是Ralph撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying Ralph lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是你卖票给我妹妹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you sold her a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,之后我们就结果了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before we killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟敢说我们家是怪胎窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You calling my family weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让你见见什么叫怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh honey you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说太土了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too rustic for your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有我太多美好的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I've a lot of great memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候常常和家人来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to come up here all the time first as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,后来和我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my parents and then with my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 里面可比在外面看舒服多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow,it's a lot nicer than it looks from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,提醒你一下 这片树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}FYI,the woods around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不熟悉的人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really easy to get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是很容易走丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't know your way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是对这片林子了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me,I know it like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了 我不会试图逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it,don't try running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,逃不了多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那些东西没用对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this doesn't work right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对吸血鬼无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}On vampires,it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是用来对付吸血鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not why I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚那句话 能说得很礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,there are about a thousand more polite ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,的方法多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到你是一群怪物养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就不和你计较了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On account of the whole raised-by-monsters thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be exhaust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你昨晚一宿没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know for a fact you didn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气 我给你铺个床\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no problem,I can make up a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,说了没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方被法院抵押了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a foreclosure,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep,it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,和其他几间一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在这儿呆过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,somebody's squatting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户被糊上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackout windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 要搭把手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you need a hand with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看来用不着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,集体外出狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go out with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把美味的食物带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring home a nice dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可为什么是你负责洗碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get stuck doing the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our roles to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的任务就是毁尸灭迹 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours being destroying the evidence,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ralph Hedges和Stacy Kepler\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ralph Hedges Stacy Kepler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么选他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any reason you targeted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,因为 饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你那帮亲友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,so,the family's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,出去餐后散步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out taking a nice after-dinner stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他们很快就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I'm sure they'll be back real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听清我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I asked was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,笔不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you all with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,说实在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正用得上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不说是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没什么损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}No skin off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 吸血鬼吸人血 碎人尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you see,a blood-sucking,body-chipping vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.41,0:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,已经丧尽天良了 但你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bad enough,but vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还绑架儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kidnap kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意你送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm going to enjoy putting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我早知道 又是Alexis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I knew this was about Alexis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那女孩早晚会坏事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl would screw everything up for us one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个把你们变成吸血鬼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in one vamp turned you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我们的小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,all of us but little sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她 神圣不可侵犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was,uh,too good to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我们怎么说 妈妈就是下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama couldn't bring herself to,no matter what we said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不管Alexis怎么捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how bad Alexis got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有未成年的小妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had a teenage sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,碍手碍脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragging her heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,无时不刻不在抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whining,near constant,about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越看不惯我们吸人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more and more about the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.41,0:17:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像她自己很高尚一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like she's somehow above it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,高人一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like she's better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为她不用吸人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause she don't feed on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是比你强 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is better than you,dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她总是很忧郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her moping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,青春期大爆发良心不安什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That teenage crisis of conscience crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我们也很烦 但是小孩儿就爱作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's annoying as hell,but it's just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真到了紧要关头\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the chips are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她还是会站在我们这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll always choose us over humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我们是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,how do you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,长久以来避开你们的追踪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stayed off your radar all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,像她那样年轻漂亮的迷途羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty,young,lost-looking thing like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让人无法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是那种死了都没人知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially to the kind of man few people would miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打猎有时候 只是为了活动筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,sure,we hunt sometimes for sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但是送上门来的 更容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a lot easier and a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safer to get delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不想告诉我名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you gonna give me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Ann\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要对你做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am about to do to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个聚会什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她是你的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your lure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼们一生的追求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best a vamp could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you better believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别太沉迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get that good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把你迷得团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her own sweet way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,女人就像吸血鬼一样嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's as bloodthirsty as any vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex?Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex?Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你做了三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃的话就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out there if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我祖母她怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没关系 毕竟那么多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's fine,it's been years and.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她也年纪大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她没接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚从本地警局查到受害者名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just ran the victims'names through local P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们俩都在O'Neill汽车站工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both work at the O'Neill bus station.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们杀了那俩人是为了Alex的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they killed them for Alex's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Jody - Dean,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jody - Dean,what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那群吸血鬼已经知道Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vamps knew that Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去苏福尔斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to Sioux Falls,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能已经过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上上路去找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way there next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,关于Alex的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something about Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are here - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the cabin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.97,0:22:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们马上过来 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are on the way - Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吗 - 对 在外面等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We moving? - Yeah,meet you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex 快 我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex,come on!We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.23,0:22:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 快救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody!Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.15,0:22:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!Are you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.36,0:23:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我追出来想阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came and I tried to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你被打晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.03,0:23:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,happens to the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着算幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lucky you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.71,0:23:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你说他们回去过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they went back to the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定已经回去过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they did,why wouldn't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在问题是 他们看到死了一个同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is what they're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they find the brother dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我们就杀回去 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we go back now - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.17,0:23:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody?Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 我们两个就可以端了他们的老窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody,we can handle a nest on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管他们住什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a fig about the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个女孩儿本来在我的保护之下 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That girl was under my protection - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a lure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是一步棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a...honey trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.53,0:23:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是她一直给吸血鬼提供食物源的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been feeding people to those vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎 不管她做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.Whatever she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一定都是被他们逼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did because they made her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这还能有理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,that's a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是个孩子 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a kid - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一个从话都说不清楚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid who's been playing vampire murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.21,0:23:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟吸血鬼一起杀人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since before she was in braces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 我哥说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody,he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.89,0:24:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的情况 也不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best,her loyalities are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.51,0:24:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她不可信 - 而且你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Screwed - And how do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她到底想不想被救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even know she wants to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的8年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past 8 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直在为整个巢穴猎食\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been baiting hook for the entire nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.58,0:24:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她手上的鲜血比我们杀过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got more blood on her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物的血都多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than most monsters we killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说她上了你们黑名单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying she's on your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 我们没这么说 - 目前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No,we are not saying that - Well,not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.02,0:24:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 她是很可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,it sucks,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.73,0:24:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们那么多年猎魔的经历告诉我们事实有多残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we hunting monsters comes harsh truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这次是清除行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a clean-up mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.27,0:24:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不是营救行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.21,0:24:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想想这些都是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this even really about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不了解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You barely know the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.47,0:24:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if either one of you lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.31,0:24:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,敢动Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much as a hand on Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.45,0:24:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,先得过我这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你在Conner手里还真是拼死挣扎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up a quite struggle with Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你差点儿把他眼睛挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said you nearly took his eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.00,0:24:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that was just.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:24:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是他把你打晕的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}His excuse for knocking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不知道你闯了多大的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea the mess you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.97,0:25:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不在的时候 两个猎人血洗了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters raided the place while we were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.61,0:25:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,折磨拷问之后 又杀了Dale\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tortured and killed Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.64,0:25:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的巢穴暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our home has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.31,0:25:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,又要重新找家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.58,0:25:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 我不是故意 - 嘘嘘嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama,I never meant - Shhhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.87,0:25:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will all find our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.58,0:25:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然一切都乱了套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things got screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.66,0:25:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但最重要的是你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.91,0:25:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我会打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'd hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.93,0:25:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的乖宝宝 我的乖Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my baby girl,not my sweet Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you even think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.59,0:26:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝 你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby,why did you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.64,0:26:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you run from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.20,0:26:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you,mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.53,0:26:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我承受不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.61,0:26:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sounds of their screams.I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.09,0:26:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我继续不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.39,0:26:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,每次完事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I feel afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.51,0:26:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那种愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.10,0:26:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁死也不要经历那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather die than feel that way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.69,0:26:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What - All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就该转化你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've turned you years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车都在车道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their truck's in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.71,0:27:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就直接走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're walking right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.82,0:27:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 以前有比这更糟的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've faced worse odds - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.47,0:27:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是突袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.95,0:27:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太感情用事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tread lightly stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是毁了他们的老窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority is clearing the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.31,0:27:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex是次要 懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex comes second,you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.18,0:27:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.79,0:27:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想亲眼看着你一点一点长大 所以我没转化你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to watch you grow up I kept putting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你还看不出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.77,0:27:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那些你经历的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things you've been feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.03,0:27:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的愧疚 所有的苦楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the guilt and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.92,0:27:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都是人类的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are human feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.31,0:27:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还不算晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以带走苦痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take the pain away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.70,0:27:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就可以永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we can stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As an family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这一切都没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like none of this ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.57,0:28:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.80,0:30:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.66,0:30:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on honey.We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走开 - 我们得快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go away - We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.65,0:30:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她选了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.07,0:30:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.23,0:30:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,想想一回到家看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a sight to come home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.41,0:30:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,自己兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.98,0:31:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,死在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying dead on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.66,0:31:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不知道是Winchester家的人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea it was a Winchester that had done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谁下的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.99,0:31:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.86,0:31:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,砍下我兄弟的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took off my brother's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.76,0:31:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.48,0:31:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.39,0:31:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.76,0:31:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一手换一足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother for a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.12,0:31:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这栋房子是个好家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place has been a good home to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你们既然毁了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since you two had to come around and ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.45,0:31:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又得上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.30,0:31:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,找新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And find a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.42,0:31:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们走的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.00,0:31:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们喜欢装好午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to pack a lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.58,0:32:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是有备而来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't say you didn't come prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别烦我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,don't be bothering my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.46,0:32:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她正在经历一个阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going through something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.62,0:32:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}A process.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.12,0:32:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你对她做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.57,0:32:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给她喝了我的血而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fed her my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.45,0:32:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在她正自己转化中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on her way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.93,0:32:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下进食即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that's left is to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.02,0:32:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.15,0:32:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经喝了你的血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already drank from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.18,0:32:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.65,0:32:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我女儿留了个好印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made an impression on my girl,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝 这是你人类的那一半在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby,this is the human half of you talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.59,0:32:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,过了这阵之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.35,0:32:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人类 对你来说什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This human,she ain't nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.01,0:32:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,话说警长啊 你有心理问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly,Sheriff,you got issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你的生活中缺了一块儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some hole in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拿我的Alex来填充\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're using my Alex to fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.97,0:32:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是平时 我会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好好过你的日子去 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and get a family of your own,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.53,0:33:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.03,0:33:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这话从你嘴里说出来还真是可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty rich coming from the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex不是你偷来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stole Alex to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.07,0:33:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我养着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have fed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.73,0:33:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,供她衣食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clothed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,9年来无时无刻不爱着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loved her going on nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.68,0:33:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得母爱只有血亲才给得起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think motherhood's just about blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不懂什么是母爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the first thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.27,0:33:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我是不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我知道什么不是母爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know what it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当她成为你的负担的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it ain't about forcing her to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,强迫她变成你就不是母爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you the second she becomes inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.02,0:33:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,看到她的伎俩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see what she is trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个贱人想让你背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hunter cop bitch is trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.06,0:33:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这样自己就有活路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn you against me to save her own hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.85,0:33:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她说的话一个字儿都不能信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe a word she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.53,0:33:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.55,0:34:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这桶差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tapped this keg.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.41,0:34:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,准备抽那个短头发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the short hear one ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.88,0:34:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该做个了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.86,0:34:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.30,0:34:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是她的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.54,0:34:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你以别人名字给她取的名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You named her after someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.52,0:34:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是你女儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.58,0:34:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直不明白为什么要改名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't figure out why you changed her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.19,0:34:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,开始还以为你对自己偷来的感到难为情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you were ashamed of your theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你根本没有羞耻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have no shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.77,0:34:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我用她填补生活中的空缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I was using her to fill a hole in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.32,0:34:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.50,0:35:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.87,0:35:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,果然同类最了解同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.71,0:35:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,死了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.34,0:35:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但心还是会痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.14,0:35:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能感觉到缺失的苦痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still feel it,the loss,the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.49,0:35:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一块儿挪不动的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a stone in your gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只有她在身边的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts just a little bit less.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.05,0:35:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,才会痛得少一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever she's near.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.75,0:35:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.29,0:36:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me,bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.15,0:36:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Yeah,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会为我做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.70,0:36:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息 女警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news,lady cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你失去的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.12,0:36:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你们很快就要团聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,非常快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.72,0:37:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.76,0:37:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.21,0:37:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我女儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.54,0:37:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.09,0:37:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't watch this,sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.66,0:38:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其那句 看着我混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me,bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.13,0:38:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么想挖苦讽刺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you got another snappy one-liners.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.65,0:38:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.80,0:38:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在我看来似乎你很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked to me like you were enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.27,0:38:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可能 有点儿过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.24,0:38:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉 我没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for not putting on the hair shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.75,0:38:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,杀那些该杀的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing things that need killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.07,0:38:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is kind of our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,从中获取愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I checked,taking pleasure in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不算犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.73,0:38:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right but.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,警局里怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's things back at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.54,0:38:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank被打惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They beat Frank up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还好能喘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least they left him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.42,0:38:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直不停的道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept apologizing for spilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.94,0:38:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他说漏嘴那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beans about the cabin,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我说那是我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told him that one's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,说到道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.92,0:38:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We own you a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.58,0:38:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们误会了那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were wrong about the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不 对于我 你们说的很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No you were right about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.78,0:39:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我失去了判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My judgement was clouded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.75,0:39:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, working this case,it brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,带回来那些感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feelings back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年我一直麻痹的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feelings I've been trying to bury for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.43,0:39:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用工作 宗教\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,buried it under work and religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.77,0:39:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至用约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.57,0:39:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how that worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.97,0:39:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那感觉还是在那 最深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still there,underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.13,0:39:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.60,0:39:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道到底是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.47,0:39:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me just that I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.92,0:39:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我骗自己能忽略这种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been fooling myself think I could ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.89,0:39:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.06,0:39:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.77,0:39:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们治Alex\N{\fnArial\fs30}For curing Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要谢我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to thank us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.86,0:39:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是解救她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who killed her sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样她就有初源的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.67,0:39:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,确定管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.72,0:39:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就我个人经验来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,speaking from experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这几天会过的很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be a rough of couple of days,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.18,0:40:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她必须克服\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定不想我们留下帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you don't want us to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.04,0:40:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.27,0:40:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,事情结束之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别我一来你就起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get up on account of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.85,0:40:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好热\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.96,0:40:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I grab a.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.37,0:40:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,过会儿就又冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be cold again in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是治疗的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the cure,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.67,0:40:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃点东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.19,0:40:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 反正都会吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I'll just throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.35,0:40:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.09,0:40:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.34,0:40:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当提出来的时候 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}When mama offered...I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.88,0:41:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想又一次让她失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't dispoint her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.13,0:41:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该惭愧到这辈子都抬不起头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had enough to be ashamed of as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.38,0:41:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 我做了一些错事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody I have done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.45,0:41:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你无需解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.35,0:41:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你想从我这里得到什么 我都会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want from me I'll give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想 我就在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你经历的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.22,0:41:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是过去的两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last 48 alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.48,0:41:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所有你认识的 你爱过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've ever known or loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.95,0:41:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.71,0:41:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can
